[{"answer":"There are hundreds of different types of flowers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Most people like roses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Roses grow on bushes, and they smell beautiful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/3.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to be careful that you don't prick your finger on a rose thorn.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Roses come in many colors.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/5.mp3"},{"answer":"There are red, pink, yellow and white roses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/6.mp3"},{"answer":"In the spring, tulips are in bloom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/7.mp3"},{"answer":"In Ottawa, there are many tulips.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people go there just to see all the tulips in the spring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Forget-me-nots are also spring flowers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/10.mp3"},{"answer":"They are tiny and blue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Lilies of the valley look like white bells.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Where I live, many of the trees have blossoms on them in the springtime.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The apple and cherry trees look particularly beautiful when they are in blossom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/14.mp3"},{"answer":"We have a blossom festival in my town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/15.mp3"},{"answer":"My neighbors like to plant geraniums, petunias and marigolds in the summer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people plant sunflowers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Sunflowers grow very tall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/18.mp3"},{"answer":"They have bright yellow petals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/19.mp3"},{"answer":"All of those flowers grow best in the sunshine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/20.mp3"},{"answer":"If your garden is shady, you have to plant different things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Hostas grow well in a shady garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Chrysanthemums are fall flowers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Chrysanthemums come in many colors also.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/24.mp3"},{"answer":"There are purple, yellow and white chrysanthemums.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Flowers are good to give as gifts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Women like to receive a dozen roses on Valentine's Day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Carnations also make a nice gift.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/28.mp3"},{"answer":"They have a very sweet smell.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Many people give away lilies for Easter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Poinsettias are very festive at Christmas time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/31.mp3"},{"answer":"If someone goes to a dance, they often give their partner a flower to wear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes, a girl will get an orchid from her date","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/33.mp3"},{"answer":"If you go to a wedding, you will probably see a lot of flowers there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Flowers help to make places beautiful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/31-flowers-2019-03-20-09-26-54/35.mp3"}]
